r* (Norwegian: *Under Høststjærnen. En Vandrers Fortælling*) by Knut Hamsun (1906) and can be translated as: ‘When I walk along the overgrown path through the forest, my heart trembles with an unearthly joy.’" height="3870" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6ac34a2a53f6c.jpg" width="3000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 06:56:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>仙人掌</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac336eb55667</link><description>&lt;p&gt;仙人掌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A cactus in a pot in front of the creek " height="6048" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/stormsignal/6ac336eb55667.jpg" width="8064"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://stormsignal.some.pics"&gt;@stormsignal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 05:34:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大自然的幽默感</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac315c731a50</link><description>&lt;p&gt;大自然有幽默感。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="This small pumpkin has two connected spheres that look a lot like a pair of testicles." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/duggan/6ac315c731a50.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://duggan.some.pics"&gt;@duggan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 03:13:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>十月的徒步是最好的徒步</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac2e6b229489</link><description>&lt;p&gt;十月的徒步是最好的徒步&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Tall deciduous trees rise up as you gaze into a bright blue sky and watch their green foliage lit by the sun" height="3250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/annie/6ac2e6b229489.jpg" width="2437"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://annie.some.pics"&gt;@annie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:52:23 +0000</pubDate></